    },
    "coordinateReferenceSystem": "EPSG:4326"
  },
  "temporalCoverage": {
    "start": "1984-08-01T00:00:00Z",
    "end":   "2023-10-31T00:00:00Z",
    "durationDays": 14244,
    "recordCountWithDates": 156,
    "granularity": "monthly"
  },
  "spatialResolution": "point‑level (single location, no variation)",
  "temporalResolution": "monthly (observation periods are grouped by month)",
  "notes": [
    "Four temporal columns were detected: Year obs, Date/time start, Date/time end, Date/Time. Only Date/time start and Date/time end contain the actual observation dates; Year obs is stored as a Unix‑epoch offset and Date/Time is a constant single‑day value, so they are not used for coverage.",
    "132 of the 288 rows have null values in both Date/time start and Date/time end; temporal coverage is derived from the 156 rows with valid timestamps.",
    "Latitude and Longitude form a coordinate pair; the detection algorithm mis‑labelled Longitude as ‘possible_latitude’, but the extent calculation confirms it is longitude.",
    "All 288 rows share the identical coordinates (48.79899472 N, 9.998824433 E), representing a single site (Aalen, Germany)."
  ]
}

